{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07279","headline":"奉和赵给事使君留赠李婺州舍人兼谢舍人别驾之什 · 刘长卿","name":"奉和赵给事使君留赠李婺州舍人兼谢舍人别驾之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"便道访情亲，东方千骑尘。\n禁深分直夜，地远独行春。\n绦阙辞明主，沧洲识近臣。\n云山随候吏，鸡犬逐归人。\n庭顾婆娑老，邦传蔽芾新。\n玄晖翻佐理，闻到郡斋频。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07279.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07279","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}